// Hanging on a rope ladder, A or D alone lets go at once: the mole drops off sideways at its own run speed
// instead of edging along the rope at a crawl. A jump lets go too; W again grabs on mid-fall (a catch), and
// that and the drop below a 0.5 m hop cost nothing.
map
